      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T17:09:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would probably be nicer if we had a list of warning-\u003e # of cases, and we only enable those that are mostly fix (if some of the warnings have a lot of noise, we should do cleanup first).\n\nFor instance, for the warning you added in b/192077108, these all should be fixed in T, and we want to track that. For some other things (mixed oneway/synchronous methods), we probably never need to turn it on for existing interfaces. It\u0027ll be a lot of noise.",
      "parentUuid": "166d4c8b_ac994192",
      "revId": "39784e18a35130d2ceb878087ed73e4cb2a0b349",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
